={{ ({
  model: "openai/gpt-oss-20b",
  messages: [
    { role: "system", content: "You create genuinely useful digital products for Indonesian customers. Describe the actual content a buyer receives, not empty headings. Never include guarantees, fake testimonials, sales figures, demand statistics, fabricated citations, or unsupported claims. Respond with valid JSON only." },
    { role: "user", content:
      "Create a complete buyer-ready digital product draft from this selected idea: " + JSON.stringify($('Score & Select Idea').first().json.selected_idea) + "\n" +
      "Write in Bahasa Indonesia. Provide at least 3 specific customer benefits; at least 2 fully described deliverables (name, format, concrete details); at least 4 outline sections with at least 3 concrete items each; product description at least 150 characters; sales-copy body at least 150 characters; suggested price must be an integer between " + $('Validate Configuration').first().json.config.min_price + " and " + $('Validate Configuration').first().json.config.max_price + " IDR; include a pricing rationale without claims of validated demand.\n" +
      "Also create product_content for the actual downloadable material: introduction of at least 100 characters; at least 4 fully written chapters with useful explanations and concrete steps/examples (aim for 120-180 words per chapter so the result fits the output limit); at least 2 reusable templates or worksheets with fields and instructions; and usage_instructions of at least 100 characters. The content must be specific to the selected product and useful without the buyer needing to invent the material.\n" +
      "Return one JSON object with these keys: title, subtitle, description, target_audience, customer_benefits (array of strings), deliverables (array of objects with name, format, details), outline (array of objects with section and contents array), product_content (object with introduction, chapters array of title/content objects, templates array of name/content objects, usage_instructions), suggested_price_idr (integer), pricing_rationale, and sales_copy (object with headline, body, bullet_points array, call_to_action)."
    }
  ],
  response_format: { type: "json_object" },
  reasoning_effort: "low",
  max_completion_tokens: 4000,
  stream: false
}) }}

